. this \nis one of their sound experiments/programs broadcasted  live. pure \nexample of their way of work. chaotic mix of sound, music,  live \nperformance with various strange instruments in the studio,  inteviews \nwhere questions are on different lenguage than the answer,  reading \npoetry, realtime edditing, manipulating pre recorded material,  playing \nchess in the studio… art on radio or radio art?</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>","licenseurl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/3.0/","radiaseason":"12","scanner":"Internet Archive HTML5 Uploader 1.6.3","subject":"radio art;Radia;Kanal 103","title":"Show 0118: Svirachinja (Kanal 103)","publicdate":"2017-04-27 21:29:11","uploader":"radia.fm@gmail.com","addeddate":"2017-04-27 21:29:11","date":"2007-07-02","creator":"Kanal 103","backup_location":"ia906403_3","external_metadata_update":"2019-04-10T12:31:16Z"},"server":"ia801403.us.archive.org","uniq":1786191853,"workable_servers":["ia801403.us.archive.org","ia601403.us.archive.org"]}